	UpgradeDescription(1)="<font color=\"#CC0000\">Soul Chain:</font> Each kill within <font color=\"#FFAA00\">5 seconds</font> adds a stack. <font color=\"#FFFFFF\">+8%</font> <font color=\"#FF6666\">damage per stack</font> (max <font color=\"#FFFFFF\">8</font> stacks). Stacks reset after <font color=\"#FFAA00\">5s</font> without a kill."

